  "prefLabel": "Plc 1302.29 Radiologist assistant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1302.29 “Radiologist assistant” means “radiologist assistant” as defined in RSA 328-J:1, XIV, namely “a radiographer who has met additional qualifications and who is licensed under this chapter to perform a variety of activities under the supervision of a radiologist in the areas of patient care, patient management, radiologic imaging, or interventional procedures guided by radiologic imaging.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1300.html"
